WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.134
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:27.404 --> 00:31.007
(Francesca Next Door)

3
00:33.076 --> 00:34.678
(All names of people, places, events, and other details are fictitious.)

4
00:34.744 --> 00:36.012
(AI-based technology was used in part of the production.)

5
00:36.079 --> 00:39.950
(One day before Pi Na Young's first day of school)

6
00:57.701 --> 00:58.702
This is...

7
01:02.672 --> 01:04.541
Where did you find that ax?

8
01:05.075 --> 01:06.343
- In the streets. - Pardon?

9
01:11.681 --> 01:14.317
Oh, but why are you putting it here?

10
01:14.584 --> 01:15.585
It's a decoration.

11
01:18.555 --> 01:20.023
I see your vision,

12
01:20.223 --> 01:22.225
but you should put it back to where you found it...

13
01:27.998 --> 01:29.165
Brilliant choice, miss.

14
01:34.838 --> 01:37.507
But are you really making me live in a place like this?

15
01:38.475 --> 01:39.909
It's smaller than my bathroom!

16
01:40.610 --> 01:43.146
I'm sorry, Ms. Francesca. Please bear with it for now.

17
01:43.780 --> 01:45.715
(Wi-Fi)

18
01:46.383 --> 01:47.517
There's no Wi-Fi either.

19
01:47.817 --> 01:50.887
I'll get your phone set up as soon as I've earned some money.

20
01:50.954 --> 01:52.522
So please be patient.

21
01:52.589 --> 01:54.557
How do I live without the Internet?

22
01:54.858 --> 01:56.092
Why did it have to be this way?

23
01:56.593 --> 01:57.594
That's because...

24
01:58.094 --> 02:00.597
your father invested in the wrong cryptocurrency...

25
02:01.498 --> 02:03.233
What kind of currency is that expensive?

26
02:06.569 --> 02:08.204
Yeah, sorry about that.

27
02:12.175 --> 02:15.412
The landlord agreed to lend you this empty house for a bit,

28
02:16.012 --> 02:17.747
so the water and power are probably shut off.

29
02:18.648 --> 02:20.050
What about food?

30
02:25.922 --> 02:26.923
You need to go to school.

31
02:27.257 --> 02:28.958
They have school lunches.

32
02:29.492 --> 02:31.594
It's free. You should be able to manage one meal on your own.

33
02:32.162 --> 02:35.365
(Student ID Pi Na Young, Dooil High School)

34
02:36.299 --> 02:37.300
Ms. Francesca.

35
02:38.134 --> 02:40.970
I'll come back for you once we sort this out,

36
02:41.037 --> 02:43.106
so please try to make do for now.

37
02:43.173 --> 02:44.174
And lastly...

38
02:44.941 --> 02:46.910
Always keep this in mind.

39
02:47.577 --> 02:49.913
You should never let anyone know that you're a vampire.

40
02:50.914 --> 02:52.048
The day anyone finds out...

41
02:55.218 --> 02:56.219
What happens then?

42
03:22.746 --> 03:23.747
Call the emergency.

43
04:01.684 --> 04:02.685
I saw it right.

44
04:03.953 --> 04:04.954
I definitely saw it.

45
04:06.022 --> 04:07.423
I'm not crazy.

46
04:08.158 --> 04:09.192
That was...

47
04:10.426 --> 04:11.494
What the heck?

48
04:12.595 --> 04:13.997
I was here first.

49
04:14.764 --> 04:15.765
Why did you run away?

50
04:16.232 --> 04:18.468
You... What are you?

51
04:19.302 --> 04:22.105
How did you just crack your neck back?

52
04:22.539 --> 04:24.207
Oh, that thing.

53
04:29.212 --> 04:32.515
I guess taking vitamins lately helped me recover faster.

54
04:32.782 --> 04:35.418
You should also take them. Vitamin C is good for skin renewal...

55
04:36.152 --> 04:37.754
Stop with all that nonsense.

56
04:41.124 --> 04:43.226
Answer my question straight.

57
04:45.261 --> 04:46.262
What are you?

58
04:47.297 --> 04:48.298
An alien?

59
04:49.165 --> 04:50.166
A ghost?

60
04:50.800 --> 04:51.868
Or is it...

61
04:54.604 --> 04:55.672
I'll make this clear.

62
04:56.506 --> 04:58.441
You didn't see anything today. Got it?

63
04:59.142 --> 05:01.878
If I hear you say one word about me to anyone,

64
05:02.679 --> 05:03.680
you...

65
05:04.948 --> 05:05.949
will die.

66
05:06.783 --> 05:07.784
All clear?

67
05:10.386 --> 05:11.387
Good.

68
05:11.454 --> 05:13.723
Then see you tomorrow, class president.

69
05:28.171 --> 05:29.172
Got it.

70
05:46.389 --> 05:48.224
This crappy house doesn't even have Wi-Fi.

71
05:51.728 --> 05:54.163
(September 1, Tuesday)

72
06:27.664 --> 06:29.899
(Where should we begin?)

73
06:29.966 --> 06:33.369
(Can a person recover on their own from a car accident injury?)

74
06:36.339 --> 06:38.074
(A human-like creature with traits of another species)

75
06:38.141 --> 06:39.742
(Something entirely nonhuman)

76
06:48.418 --> 06:49.419
An alien?

77
06:50.586 --> 06:51.587
A ghost?

78
06:53.489 --> 06:55.425
Seriously, what is she?

79
07:00.530 --> 07:02.498
(Dalbit-ro)

80
07:14.110 --> 07:16.212
- What are you doing? - Hey, class president.

81
07:17.981 --> 07:19.015
Did you follow me...

82
07:19.349 --> 07:20.583
to kill me?

83
07:20.950 --> 07:24.187
What are you talking about? This spot has great Wi-Fi.

84
07:29.192 --> 07:30.193
Wi-Fi?

85
07:46.142 --> 07:47.610
Is it because of this?

86
08:05.828 --> 08:06.829
What?

87
08:09.265 --> 08:10.266
Class president!

88
08:10.833 --> 08:12.869
Hey, open the door!

89
08:13.302 --> 08:15.371
- Did you set up a password? Unlock it! - Just leave.

90
08:15.438 --> 08:17.440
Please get out of there.

91
08:19.542 --> 08:20.543
Unlock it!

92
08:29.519 --> 08:30.520
Is she gone?

93
08:37.193 --> 08:38.761
I'm so screwed.

94
08:40.163 --> 08:43.499
(Dooil High School)

95
08:46.903 --> 08:47.970
Hey, class president.

96
09:00.183 --> 09:01.651
Despite his beloved's departure,

97
09:01.717 --> 09:03.786
the speaker hasn't accepted the separation.

98
09:04.187 --> 09:07.290
Instead, he believes they'll meet again.

99
09:07.757 --> 09:11.594
Toward the end of the verse, his attitude changes...

100
09:12.462 --> 09:15.264
- Hey, class president. I'm... - I should go to the restroom.

101
09:39.388 --> 09:40.523
- Are you avoiding me? - Oh, jeez!

102
09:41.524 --> 09:42.558
Don't sneak up on me.

103
09:43.159 --> 09:44.293
Why are you avoiding me?

104
09:45.761 --> 09:46.829
I'm not.

105
09:47.196 --> 09:48.498
You have been all day.

106
09:48.965 --> 09:51.134
I told you not to spread the word, not to hide from me!

107
09:53.836 --> 09:54.837
That's because...

108
10:04.514 --> 10:05.515
Password.

109
10:06.282 --> 10:08.050
- What? - The Wi-Fi password.

110
10:08.818 --> 10:10.887
You set it up, right? Unlock it.

111
10:11.954 --> 10:13.389
I don't know what you mean.

112
10:13.789 --> 10:14.891
Are you serious?

113
10:14.957 --> 10:18.694
Hey, I'm sorry, but I have to go. I've got something to do.

114
10:29.038 --> 10:31.007
Why is it so hard to get a little studying done?

115
10:36.612 --> 10:37.613
Hey, class president.

116
10:41.484 --> 10:43.653
She didn't look that dangerous.

117
10:45.454 --> 10:48.257
An alien or the Buddha, it's none of my business.

118
10:49.158 --> 10:50.426
I shouldn't get involved.

119
10:50.493 --> 10:52.695
I should just focus on the next mock exam.

120
10:53.095 --> 10:54.764
That's what I should be doing.

121
10:54.830 --> 10:56.065
- Class president. - Yeah?

122
10:56.499 --> 10:57.533
Mr. Chung wants to see you.

123
10:59.101 --> 11:00.102
Excuse me?

124
11:00.169 --> 11:04.407
I noticed she actually listens when you tell her something.

125
11:05.775 --> 11:07.877
But that's just not fair.

126
11:08.644 --> 11:10.813
Why should I tutor her?

127
11:11.614 --> 11:13.049
That's what you should do.

128
11:13.115 --> 11:15.585
I know it's my responsibility, but...

129
11:16.586 --> 11:20.590
I've had a lot on my plate since becoming department head.

130
11:21.023 --> 11:24.560
Trust me, I'm not asking you to do much.

131
11:24.927 --> 11:25.995
This coming mock exam,

132
11:26.462 --> 11:30.099
just help her get an average score of at least 50.

133
11:30.900 --> 11:32.168
You can do this.

134
11:33.135 --> 11:34.136
No, sir.

135
11:34.203 --> 11:36.038
No matter how I look at it, it doesn't seem right.

136
11:37.139 --> 11:38.140
I can't do it.

137
11:40.910 --> 11:41.911
U Ju...

138
11:43.312 --> 11:45.281
Aren't you running for student council president next year?

139
11:46.182 --> 11:47.617
Hey, listen.

140
11:47.683 --> 11:49.986
If you build some leadership skills,

141
11:50.052 --> 11:52.021
I can write you a good recommendation letter...

142
11:52.088 --> 11:53.856
for your student council president election.

143
11:54.123 --> 11:55.124
This would really help...

144
11:55.191 --> 11:58.060
with your college application under the leadership category.

145
11:59.128 --> 12:00.529
Isn't med school your goal?

146
12:32.662 --> 12:34.764
Hey, Grass. Where's the class president?

147
12:35.765 --> 12:37.533
How would I know?

148
12:37.600 --> 12:38.634
I'm not even surprised.

149
12:39.669 --> 12:40.770
Where the heck is he?

150
12:41.137 --> 12:42.138
Are you looking for someone?

151
12:52.348 --> 12:53.416
What do you want?

152
12:53.616 --> 12:54.650
Me?

153
12:54.717 --> 12:56.319
I'm here to say hi to my friend.

154
12:56.786 --> 12:59.188
I thought both people had to agree to be friends.

155
12:59.522 --> 13:00.856
I never agreed to this...

156
13:00.923 --> 13:02.124
unless you plan on serving me.

157
13:02.458 --> 13:03.859
Let me give you some advice as a friend.

158
13:04.126 --> 13:05.127
Advice?

159
13:05.928 --> 13:07.897
Don't get too involved with the humans.

160
13:08.097 --> 13:09.732
I guess you're quite anti-social.

161
13:10.366 --> 13:11.367
Especially...

162
13:12.635 --> 13:13.636
him.

163
13:17.640 --> 13:18.641
Hey, class president.

164
13:18.774 --> 13:20.409
Come inside. I have something to tell you.

165
13:20.976 --> 13:21.977
Okay.

166
13:32.288 --> 13:33.456
(CSAT Workbooks)

167
13:33.923 --> 13:34.924
What are these?

168
13:36.425 --> 13:38.394
These are the subjects you should study from now on.

169
13:38.761 --> 13:39.762
Why should I?

170
13:40.730 --> 13:41.897
You'll kill me if I tell?

171
13:42.698 --> 13:43.833
That means...

172
13:43.899 --> 13:45.701
you'd be in trouble if your identity got out.

173
13:46.736 --> 13:47.870
I'll keep your secret,

174
13:48.404 --> 13:51.107
but only if you let me tutor you.

175
13:51.440 --> 13:54.377
I threatened you last night. I didn't ask you for a favor.

176
13:56.512 --> 13:57.513
Do you really want to die?

177
14:03.152 --> 14:04.153
Go ahead.

178
14:04.353 --> 14:06.088
I'd rather die than not get into med school.

179
14:06.722 --> 14:07.723
Kill me, then.

180
14:08.457 --> 14:09.458
What?

181
14:09.759 --> 14:12.395
Whoever you are, I must make you study.

182
14:14.997 --> 14:16.098
I'm not asking for much.

183
14:17.633 --> 14:19.969
Try to get an average above 50.

184
14:21.003 --> 14:22.104
It's easy.

185
14:22.638 --> 14:23.639
Just get half of them right.

186
14:33.916 --> 14:36.018
Fine, but I have one condition.

187
14:36.652 --> 14:37.686
Which is?

188
14:37.753 --> 14:39.588
You should be my butler.

189
14:39.655 --> 14:40.656
What?

190
14:40.723 --> 14:42.324
Show me things, like you did yesterday,

191
14:42.391 --> 14:43.426
about the human world.

192
14:45.094 --> 14:47.163
Now you're openly admitting you're not human.

193
14:47.229 --> 14:48.230
So?

194
14:48.497 --> 14:49.498
Are you in?

195
14:54.603 --> 14:55.604
A guide.

196
14:56.772 --> 14:58.140
I'll be your guide, not a butler.

197
14:59.141 --> 15:00.342
I have no intention of serving you.

198
15:00.676 --> 15:03.312
Okay, fine. Plus, give me the Wi-Fi password.

199
15:03.379 --> 15:05.114
What? That's a no.

200
15:05.181 --> 15:06.182
Then I won't cooperate.

201
15:10.786 --> 15:11.787
How about this?

202
15:16.058 --> 15:17.526
(Connections)

203
15:17.593 --> 15:19.328
(Mobile Hotspot and Tethering)

204
15:23.699 --> 15:25.301
(Wi-Fi Universe's Galaxy)

205
15:26.602 --> 15:27.636
One hour a day.

206
15:27.903 --> 15:30.206
I'll let you use it if you study what I teach you.

207
15:32.708 --> 15:33.709
No more compromises.

208
15:34.343 --> 15:35.344
If you don't like it,

209
15:35.945 --> 15:36.946
- do as you wish. - Deal.

210
15:38.280 --> 15:39.281
Deal.

211
15:40.516 --> 15:43.252
We'll study at my place after school.

212
15:43.819 --> 15:44.820
Until then,

213
15:45.754 --> 15:46.922
have a look at these.

214
15:48.624 --> 15:49.758
I don't think you will, but...

215
15:51.627 --> 15:54.129
Then until school ends,

216
15:55.431 --> 15:56.565
don't talk to me.

217
16:07.343 --> 16:09.044
(Wi-Fi Universe's Galaxy)

218
16:21.557 --> 16:22.558
Class president!

219
16:30.266 --> 16:32.368
Please. Do you have to be so loud?

220
16:32.835 --> 16:33.869
Why should I keep it quiet?

221
16:35.337 --> 16:37.006
Gosh, never mind.

222
16:37.072 --> 16:38.073
Come. Follow me.

223
16:47.316 --> 16:48.317
You might trip and fall.

224
16:48.918 --> 16:50.319
Shouldn't you tie your shoe?

225
16:50.386 --> 16:51.420
I don't know how.

226
16:57.826 --> 16:58.827
Stop for a minute.

227
17:04.833 --> 17:06.435
Didn't anyone teach you how to tie this?

228
17:07.102 --> 17:08.604
My butler does everything for me.

229
17:08.938 --> 17:09.939
I have nothing to do.

230
17:10.739 --> 17:11.740
Your butler?

231
17:11.807 --> 17:12.841
So you have one at home?

232
17:13.242 --> 17:14.243
Not now.

233
17:14.310 --> 17:15.511
He's out for work.

234
17:15.578 --> 17:17.079
My family went broke.

235
17:18.847 --> 17:19.848
What about your parents?

236
17:19.915 --> 17:20.916
They're not here.

237
17:23.586 --> 17:24.887
- Do you live alone? - Yes.

238
17:35.764 --> 17:36.799
There.

239
17:39.368 --> 17:40.369
It's tied.

240
17:42.571 --> 17:45.307
I'll teach you how to tie your shoes later...

241
17:45.374 --> 17:46.442
so you can do it yourself.

242
17:46.942 --> 17:47.943
Okay.

243
17:55.084 --> 17:57.353
By the way, what's your real name?

244
17:58.020 --> 17:59.021
My real name?

245
17:59.555 --> 18:00.623
It should be Romanian, no?

246
18:01.390 --> 18:02.958
It can't be Pi Na Young.

247
18:03.492 --> 18:05.361
Oh, my real name is...

248
18:05.427 --> 18:08.330
Francesca Alexandra Cantemir Dumitrescu...

249
18:08.731 --> 18:11.300
Never mind. I'll just call you Na Young.

250
18:12.001 --> 18:13.002
Okay.

251
18:21.210 --> 18:22.211
Come in.

252
18:35.057 --> 18:36.058
What are you doing?

253
18:37.960 --> 18:38.961
You have power.

254
18:46.201 --> 18:47.236
You have water!

255
18:49.805 --> 18:50.806
It's so cool.

256
18:54.009 --> 18:55.244
It's better than my place.

257
18:55.978 --> 18:57.646
What kind of life are you living?

258
18:59.581 --> 19:02.084
Anyway, I'll bring the study materials. Wait right here.

259
19:15.698 --> 19:17.499
Hey, I've been saving that!

260
19:18.934 --> 19:21.370
- Aren't you going to study? - Why should I?

261
19:21.437 --> 19:23.405
I like it here. I'll just live here.

262
19:23.639 --> 19:25.474
The audacity to say that in front of the host.

263
19:27.142 --> 19:28.444
Sit up. We have to study.

264
19:28.510 --> 19:29.511
I don't want to.

265
19:34.616 --> 19:35.617
(Connections)

266
19:35.684 --> 19:37.052
(Mobile Hotspot and Tethering)

267
19:37.119 --> 19:38.554
(Off)

268
19:43.225 --> 19:44.226
Hey!

269
19:45.027 --> 19:46.061
It's just an hour.

270
19:46.261 --> 19:47.629
Study hard for an hour,

271
19:47.696 --> 19:49.164
and I'll keep it on for the rest of the day.

272
19:50.899 --> 19:53.068
So sit over there.

273
20:08.250 --> 20:09.885
Solve up to this question.

274
20:10.586 --> 20:11.620
Ask me when you're stuck.

275
20:16.725 --> 20:17.726
I have a question.

276
20:18.727 --> 20:19.728
What is it?

277
20:19.795 --> 20:22.865
Cheol Su gave 2 apples to Yeong Hui when he had 5 at first.

278
20:23.766 --> 20:24.900
Why would he give them away?

279
20:27.469 --> 20:29.538
It's just a question. You have to do the math.

280
20:30.773 --> 20:31.774
Is that so?

281
20:38.914 --> 20:41.717
Cheol Su took 6 hours to finish a job when Yeong Hui did it in 3 hours.

282
20:42.751 --> 20:44.019
Isn't he stupid?

283
20:45.287 --> 20:46.455
I guess he's slow.

284
20:54.763 --> 20:57.232
Cheol Su ran 3km to Yeong Hui's house,

285
20:58.000 --> 20:59.868
so how much does he love her?

286
21:04.339 --> 21:05.607
Are you doing this on purpose?

287
21:19.988 --> 21:22.090
One hour is over. That's it for today.

288
21:25.093 --> 21:26.094
Go home.

289
21:26.395 --> 21:27.763
No, I want to stay.

290
21:28.263 --> 21:29.398
You'd better leave...

291
21:29.932 --> 21:31.667
if you want to get even a single bar of signal.

292
21:49.351 --> 21:51.086
Why is everyone in white except for you?

293
21:51.486 --> 21:52.487
They're all doctors.

294
21:54.690 --> 21:55.757
Doctors?

295
21:55.824 --> 21:56.992
You don't know what that is?

296
21:57.659 --> 21:58.660
I do.

297
21:58.727 --> 21:59.928
They help people heal.

298
22:00.395 --> 22:02.264
I never get hurt, so I've never met one.

299
22:03.398 --> 22:04.399
Right.

300
22:05.367 --> 22:07.302
I have to go to med school to become a doctor too,

301
22:07.836 --> 22:09.705
and I have to tutor you to get into med school.

302
22:11.740 --> 22:14.176
Why is tutoring me necessary for you to get into med school?

303
22:16.511 --> 22:17.512
That's how it works.

304
22:18.647 --> 22:20.582
Sure, it's none of my business.

305
22:21.049 --> 22:24.152
Anyway, I thought doctors made a lot of money.

306
22:25.020 --> 22:27.089
Isn't this place a little shabby for a family of doctors?

307
22:28.557 --> 22:29.625
Thanks for the compliment.

308
22:31.426 --> 22:32.728
It's our family tradition...

309
22:32.794 --> 22:35.430
to donate all our earnings except for the living expenses.

310
22:36.031 --> 22:37.532
They have so much compassion for humanity.

311
22:39.902 --> 22:41.236
Now will you please go?

312
22:48.277 --> 22:49.745
Why do you want to be a doctor?

313
22:50.679 --> 22:52.180
Do you have someone you want to heal?

314
22:54.149 --> 22:55.150
No.

315
22:55.217 --> 22:56.585
Then why?

316
22:57.586 --> 22:58.587
That's because...

317
22:59.054 --> 23:01.623
my mom, dad, sister, and brother are all doctors.

318
23:06.595 --> 23:09.464
Does that mean you have to be one as well?

319
23:13.368 --> 23:14.369
That's not...

320
23:19.508 --> 23:20.876
Go home right now.

321
23:21.877 --> 23:23.145
But I don't want to.

322
23:23.211 --> 23:24.513
Please, I beg you.

323
23:30.118 --> 23:31.286
See you, class president.

324
23:46.234 --> 23:48.236
(Dalbit-ro)

325
23:55.744 --> 23:57.713
(Butler Francisco)

326
23:59.114 --> 24:00.148
Ms. Francesca!

327
24:00.315 --> 24:01.383
Oh, it's you.

328
24:01.717 --> 24:03.018
Why is it so hard to reach you?

329
24:03.085 --> 24:04.419
I was worried sick!

330
24:04.853 --> 24:06.288
I have no Wi-Fi.

331
24:06.355 --> 24:07.656
Get my phone activated already.

332
24:09.358 --> 24:10.559
Are you doing okay?

333
24:10.625 --> 24:11.660
How was school?

334
24:13.295 --> 24:14.863
Well, it's not bad.

335
24:14.930 --> 24:16.064
I have someone who looks after me.

336
24:16.264 --> 24:17.265
Looks after you?

337
24:18.767 --> 24:20.102
(Delivery order came in.)

338
24:20.168 --> 24:21.236
I got another one.

339
24:22.137 --> 24:24.506
Ms. Francesca, I have to get going.

340
24:24.773 --> 24:25.774
Already?

341
24:29.211 --> 24:31.847
Ms. Francesca, you have to keep a low profile...

342
24:32.214 --> 24:34.149
until I come back for you.

343
24:34.916 --> 24:37.719
Don't let anyone find out that you're a vampire.

344
24:38.220 --> 24:39.221
Never.

345
24:39.955 --> 24:40.956
Oh, about that...

346
24:41.289 --> 24:42.290
(Call ended.)

347
25:01.476 --> 25:03.011
- Why are you so late? - Oh, my gosh!

348
25:06.581 --> 25:07.582
What's going on?

349
25:07.849 --> 25:09.384
I can't charge my phone at home.

350
25:10.519 --> 25:11.586
What?

351
25:21.229 --> 25:22.230
Oh, no.

352
25:24.566 --> 25:25.567
Why are you following me?

353
25:26.468 --> 25:28.103
The signal gets weak when you're too far.

354
25:28.503 --> 25:29.571
Don't move around so much.

355
25:31.173 --> 25:32.174
What are you saying?

356
25:37.212 --> 25:38.380
(Toilet Man)

357
25:47.956 --> 25:48.957
What took you so long?

358
25:51.426 --> 25:52.461
Hey, you...

359
26:06.775 --> 26:07.776
Don't move.

360
26:08.710 --> 26:09.711
Stay right there.

361
26:13.849 --> 26:14.850
I said, don't move.

362
26:20.422 --> 26:22.757
Keep this much space between us outside of class.

363
26:25.160 --> 26:27.062
What's wrong with being close? I didn't ask for anything.

364
26:27.496 --> 26:28.497
What I'm saying is...

365
26:29.931 --> 26:32.901
It makes me really uncomfortable. Stay away from me.

366
26:32.968 --> 26:33.969
Do you understand?

367
26:42.144 --> 26:43.812
Wait, that's not what I...

368
26:48.683 --> 26:50.218
- A bug. - What?

369
27:18.647 --> 27:19.948
Shouldn't you stay away from me?

370
27:25.954 --> 27:26.988
Hey...

371
27:27.055 --> 27:28.089
Anyway...

372
27:29.291 --> 27:30.358
Keep your distance.

373
27:30.425 --> 27:31.426
Okay?

374
27:56.284 --> 27:57.452
Aren't you eating that one?

375
28:13.201 --> 28:14.836
Don't go too far!

376
28:14.903 --> 28:16.738
It's hard to keep up with you!

377
28:41.062 --> 28:42.063
Is this thing...

378
28:43.732 --> 28:44.833
delicious?

379
28:45.734 --> 28:47.035
Give it to me if you don't like it.

380
28:48.703 --> 28:50.305
I know something that tastes better than this.

381
28:52.307 --> 28:53.375
Don't you want to find out?

382
28:53.642 --> 28:54.843
You know something better?

383
28:57.646 --> 28:58.647
There's a ton.

384
29:00.882 --> 29:02.284
Something like human blood.

385
29:21.670 --> 29:22.804
Do I have something on my face?

386
29:23.772 --> 29:25.040
Why are you staring at me?

387
29:25.840 --> 29:28.109
You're the first of my kind I've met besides my father.

388
29:29.711 --> 29:30.712
By the way,

389
29:32.314 --> 29:33.481
do you really have some?

390
29:33.648 --> 29:34.649
Have what?

391
29:37.786 --> 29:38.787
This?

392
29:40.088 --> 29:41.890
(Blood)

393
29:43.291 --> 29:44.392
So this is...

394
29:45.327 --> 29:46.328
What is it?

395
29:46.928 --> 29:48.029
Don't tell me.

396
29:48.730 --> 29:49.831
You've never had this?

397
29:51.633 --> 29:54.836
My father said drinking human blood...

398
29:55.170 --> 29:56.338
was beneath us these days.

399
29:57.539 --> 29:58.540
"Beneath us?"

400
30:00.208 --> 30:01.209
Really?

401
30:05.947 --> 30:07.682
I'll let you have it for free this time.

402
30:09.184 --> 30:10.285
Think of it as a friendship gift.

403
30:11.353 --> 30:14.589
Drink it or throw it away. It's all up to you.

404
30:19.260 --> 30:20.261
Bye now.

405
30:37.245 --> 30:39.080
No, don't do it.

406
30:39.147 --> 30:41.316
It's uncivilized.

407
30:42.183 --> 30:43.318
It's disgraceful...

408
30:44.319 --> 30:46.254
as a vampire to...

409
31:13.715 --> 31:15.450
I've studied enough for today.

410
31:24.826 --> 31:25.827
But...

411
31:27.896 --> 31:30.198
she's probably somewhere around here.

412
31:34.436 --> 31:36.271
(Dooil High School)

413
31:36.337 --> 31:37.338
Pi Na Young?

414
31:45.079 --> 31:46.080
Where is she?

415
31:53.888 --> 31:54.889
You were here.

416
31:56.424 --> 31:57.525
Hey, let's go home.

417
32:06.234 --> 32:07.235
Did you hear me?

418
32:17.045 --> 32:18.046
Hey.

419
32:20.682 --> 32:21.683
I'm leaving.

420
32:28.389 --> 32:30.225
Gosh, my nose is bleeding.

421
32:30.758 --> 32:33.728
You're such a handful, you're giving me a nosebleed.

422
32:34.562 --> 32:35.563
Do you have a tissue?

423
32:36.898 --> 32:38.099
Na Young?

424
32:38.533 --> 32:39.534
Oh, gosh.

425
32:41.402 --> 32:42.403
What's this now?

426
32:43.638 --> 32:44.639
What's wrong?

427
32:45.573 --> 32:46.674
Are you okay?

428
32:47.642 --> 32:48.643
Just...

429
32:49.277 --> 32:50.278
Just one bite.

430
32:50.712 --> 32:51.713
What?

431
32:54.616 --> 32:56.251
Hey, snap out of it!

432
32:57.352 --> 32:59.287
Why are you...

433
32:59.787 --> 33:00.788
Na Young!

434
33:08.496 --> 33:09.497
Are you a vampire?

435
33:12.200 --> 33:13.201
What?

436
33:24.345 --> 33:25.346
You have...

437
33:26.114 --> 33:28.950
red eyes and sharp fangs.

438
33:30.351 --> 33:31.352
Hey...

439
33:32.520 --> 33:34.389
You're a vampire, right?

440
33:46.000 --> 33:48.303
(Francesca Next Door)

441
33:48.327 --> 33:50.327
MkvDrama.Net
